BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.8 Tm /F3 10.2 Tf 15 TL 1.177288 Tw (This project demonstrates a UDP-based multiplayer client-server application integrated with an SDN-controlled) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.106426 Tw (virtual network. Player registration and validation are implemented at the application server, while Mininet and) Tj T* 0 Tw .275126 Tw (Open vSwitch provide the emulated network environment. The Ryu controller monitors port statistics and updates) Tj T* 0 Tw (OpenFlow rules to select a higher-priority HTB queue for registered game traffic during congestion.) Tj T* ET
