.12549 .164706 .219608 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.8 Tm /F3 10.2 Tf 15 TL 3.38976 Tw (The experimental results show that dynamic prioritisation can substantially improve responsiveness under) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.926374 Tw (background flooding. For P2, average latency decreases from 72.7 ms in Flood Baseline to 2.2 ms in Flood) Tj T* 0 Tw .075497 Tw (Dynamic, an improvement of approximately 97%. The results also show reduced jitter. The configured packet-loss) Tj T* 0 Tw (scenarios demonstrate that prioritisation does not guarantee elimination of packet loss.) Tj T* ET
